        {
          "name": "pqs:context",
          "value": "Keccak-256 (pre-standard SHA-3 padding) is the Monero consensus hash: block/transaction IDs, tree_hash, Hn() hash-to-scalar feeding one-time keys and subaddresses, base58 address checksums (address.rs:290/312), CLSAG signature_hash message, and view tags. Quantum impact limited to Grover (square-root preimage speedup) — not urgent; the algorithm is fixed by protocol consensus, observable here. All 28 site packages were reviewed (pages 1-2)."
